Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,SHOCHIKU FILMS LTD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Produced by:\NKOIKE KAZUO COMPANY LTD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Produced in Cooperation with:\NEIZO KYOTO COMPANY LTD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Ogami Itto, the Shōgun's Executioner and I'm now going to behead you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you have any last words you'd like to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that I might tread\Nbravely on the five paths...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,between heaven and earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I may thus...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,attain salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:51.44,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(176,75)}Lone Wolf and Cub
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:51.44,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,535)}With Those Little Hands of Yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:39.25,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\fs38\frz359.9\pos(516,459)}I NAME HIM, DAIGORO
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he is smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father asks you\Nto be brave and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,as you walk the five paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Daigoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When you grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,what will you see with those eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you touch\Nwith these little hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The carp are swimming upstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yagyu Kurando...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, the Shogun's heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Kinimatsu, turns six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu and the Suio...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,will compete on his birthday,\Nin front of the Shogun to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,which of these two schools of\Nswordsmanship he will be trained in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not deserve this great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I express my humblest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I undertake this task with deep respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This contest should not take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I opposed it in the Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but Yagyu Bizen insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu clan wants\Nthe post of Official Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They are plotting to\Ndominate the Shogun's Council...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and control all the 60 provinces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Beside the Shogun,\Nonly you, as Official Executioner
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,may wear the Tokugawa hollyhock crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must win this contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You must win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to stake even\Nmy head on this contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no better\Nchance for the Yagyu clan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to strengthen its foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we must all act\Nwith our greatest resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurando!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You will lead the Yagyu\Nclan against Ogami Itto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Return glorious in victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Retsudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This will secure the future of our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one in our\Nclan who can stand alone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,against the Suio-ryu\N'Water-Gull' technique he uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying our Yagyu\Ncan't match the sword of Suio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, that if we lose,\Nthe Yagyu clan will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the only one who\Ncan stand against Ogami Itto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are a shadow Yagyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can know your\Nbranch of the clan exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the three of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurando, Hyoga and myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,are officially members of the Yagyu clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your sons,\NBenma, Tenma and Raima,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,can only work behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The same is true of Nanao, your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.17,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot fight in this, my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you know we will lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must be appointed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the young lord's teacher,\Nwithout a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If the shadow Yagyu killed him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one who\Ncould assassinate Ogami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the contest takes place,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find a way to have\Nhim removed from his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanao...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around Ogami's estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,See if there is a shrine there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way you can\Nwithdraw from this contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What harm would there\Nbe if the Yagyu won?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever we might lose,\Nwhat harm would there be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that something\Nterrible will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Daigoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The house of Ogami has\Na tradition of swordsmanship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and a special place amongst\Nthe Shogun's retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As Official Executioner,\NI hold an important position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if they have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but that would not be good government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It would weaken the\NTokugawa Shogunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Azami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the three of us to live happily together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Azami...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a sachet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right Daigoro.\NCome on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay.\NI think he likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just something my father gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father must be very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This little one must have\Ncome out to meet his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro. Daddy's not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing from Bizen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing unusual going on around you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.39,0:15:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu will try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu have always\Ntrampled on anyone in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is never any proof\Nthat they have done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was just some proof...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That the Yagyu clan\Nhas a "shadow" branch...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,whose leader is Yagyu Retsudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We could eliminate\Nthe Yagyu if that was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yagyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Early this morning,\Nsome men committed seppuku
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,outside the Yagyu mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here because\Nof accusations against you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,made in a letter one of\Nthem held between his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Accusations?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The written are three\Nmen of the fief of Ikama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were second at the\Nexecution of their lord, Hirotada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Denunciation"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Whereas the abolition of our clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"and the suicide of our lord,\Nreflect moral government,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"we bear neither rancor,\Nnor treasonous intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"We denounce only Ogami Itto,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:19:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"second at the seppuku\Nof our Lord Hirotada.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Though, by the Shogun's grace...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"he is Official Second at ritual suicides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"he has conspired with the\Nlords of the West to make
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"this power his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"He has sought, treacherously to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"see the Tokugawa Shogun\Ncursed and undermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Proof will be found in\Nthe Ogami family shrine."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My duty is to search the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This memorial tablet\Nbears the revered crest...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,of the house of our Lord Tokugawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,this memorial to the Shogun's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In this shrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for the Lords\NI have assisted in suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That Shogun tablet should not be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As Inspector General, I will investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto, you are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yagyu, why have your\Nmen come dressed to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought we might have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you would have\Ncome that way from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There would have been no\Nneed to hide under top coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell the shadow\Nbranch of the Yagyu clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.49,0:21:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by shadow branch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting we have
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a secret and an official Yagyu branch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yagyu Retsudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,His is the shadow clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never heard of\Nany shadow Yagyu clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Need we say more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.65,0:22:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Azami!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There has been some mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He was away...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This does not concern you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.99,0:22:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.99,0:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Azami... Azami!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dai...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.79,0:27:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.74,0:28:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No! The Suio Style has\Nthe advantage in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.61,0:29:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back Kurando!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.07,0:29:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.55,0:30:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto... you villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.57,0:30:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.95,0:30:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,These articles are evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Suo...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.37,0:31:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you justify\Nthese undeniable facts?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.45,0:31:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Lord Bizen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.35,0:32:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yagyu, Inspector General or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.62,0:32:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot agree to you\Npassing instant sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.16,0:32:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,especially on Ogami Itto,\Nthe Official Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.16,0:32:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There is some mistake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.40,0:32:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I respectfully urge an investigation...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.54,0:32:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to uncover the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.23,0:33:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.73,0:33:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.87,0:33:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,your father will be a\Ndemon on the path of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.91,0:33:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will expose the crimes\Nof the Yagyu to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.51,0:34:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You will join...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,your mother in the realm of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.52,0:34:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Daigoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Azami!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.01,0:36:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear this...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.55,0:36:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto, military officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.22,0:36:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Though serving as\Nour Official Executioner...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.59,0:36:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he has acted outrageously\Nand is relieved of his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.89,0:36:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His house is abolished,\Nhis name expunged...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and he and his son\NDaigoro are to commit seppuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.11,0:36:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How appropriate that the\NOfficial Executioner comes to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.25,0:37:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,wearing the white funerary robes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.36,0:37:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.06,0:37:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not come here in these\Nrobes to disembowel myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.00,0:37:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we are dressed in celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as we set out on the path of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.72,0:37:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Shogun's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.73,0:37:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That is no more than a joke to
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.26,0:37:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,one that will walk the path of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.23,0:37:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto has gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To arms!\NOgami Itto has gone mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.99,0:38:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You unsheathe your swords\Nbefore the hollyhock crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.03,0:38:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove it! Remove that crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.50,0:38:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I claim the right to a proper duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.79,0:38:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous shadow Yagyu...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yagyu Retsudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.41,0:39:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If and when you defeat the Yagyu...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.28,0:39:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It matters not to me where you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.25,0:39:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and your child go or how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.69,0:39:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it is outside Edo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.29,0:39:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu will say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.86,0:39:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.76,0:39:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu are warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.07,0:39:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One who lives by the\Nsword is true to his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.11,0:39:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Itto wants to expose the\Nshadow branch of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.38,0:39:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Matsudaira is behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.02,0:39:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it all the more important
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.52,0:39:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that the truth about our\Ntwo houses remains unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.89,0:39:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it is hidden,\Nour secret branch is powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bizen... listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I live by the sword.\NI will fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.64,0:40:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.51,0:40:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the Shogun knows our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.31,0:40:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yagyu are finished\Nif the truth is revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.38,0:40:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.59,0:40:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it not your branch that\Nraised us to these heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.96,0:40:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.66,0:40:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On my honor as a Yagyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.87,0:40:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.75,0:40:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall avenge my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.96,0:41:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father. He will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.86,0:41:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogo...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.16,0:41:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have only just taken a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.70,0:41:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.97,0:41:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But father...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have children!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.91,0:41:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ensure that the Yagyu line continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.51,0:41:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.12,0:41:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogo...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.26,0:41:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one time that\Nyou might prevail against Itto.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.00,0:41:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is when the\Nevening sun is at your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.42,0:43:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.40,0:43:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.48,0:44:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you let him get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.95,0:44:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the only one who\Nknows of our shadow branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.72,0:44:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.63,0:44:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The word of a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.50,0:45:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow branch is\Nnot of the warrior class...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.10,0:45:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so your 'word of\Na warrior' means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.41,0:45:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the truth of 'moral government.'
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.18,0:45:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun receives me in audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.55,0:45:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.86,0:45:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow branch can\Nsurvive only as assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.73,0:45:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to pursue Ogami\NItto and kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,even to the ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.14,0:45:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you grown old, Yagyu Retsudo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.68,0:45:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fool yourself, Bizen!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.78,0:45:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it that put you\Nin the Shogun's Council?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.22,0:46:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Representing the Yagyu family,\Nyou have achieved the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.76,0:46:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,of a Shogunate Minister\Nwithout soiling your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.63,0:46:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That has always been\Nthe dearest wish of all Yagyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.87,0:46:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's always been the other\Nbranch, wretched, disowned...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.91,0:46:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that has plied murder on murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.05,0:46:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Striking from the dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.92,0:46:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to shed blood and bury those\Nthat would oppose our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.73,0:48:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"One is for fig, two is for carrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Three is for pepper tree,\Nfour for mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Five is for burdock, six for barleycorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.44,0:48:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Seven for the seven herbs,\Neight for the eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.14,0:48:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nine for cucumber, ten for green pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.65,0:48:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nine for cucumber,\Nten for green pepper."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.52,0:48:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.42,0:48:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.23,0:48:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.95,0:49:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.98,0:49:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.96,0:49:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"One is for fig, two is for carrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.03,0:49:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"Three is for pepper tree,\Nfour for mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.96,0:49:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Five is for burdock, six for barleycorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Seven for the seven herbs,\Neight for the eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nine for cucumber, ten for green pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.57,0:49:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nine for cucumber,\Nten for green pepper."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.18,0:49:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.29,0:49:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how he has grown...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.20,0:50:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how he has grown...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.65,0:50:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.26,0:51:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Ogami Itto?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.13,0:51:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He is in meditation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.73,0:51:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will speak to him,\Nbut whether he will answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.54,0:51:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogunate is mining\Ngold on the Sugu River
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.41,0:51:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,in Mutsu Province, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.52,0:51:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This year the government says they
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.82,0:51:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,will bring the gold through Tanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.02,0:51:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They will pass along the\NMita road and across the lands
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.53,0:51:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,of our Iwakidaira clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.47,0:51:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's the order of\NGeneral Inspector Yagyu Bizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.44,0:51:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogunate is after\Nyour 30,000-koku stipend.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.41,0:51:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That is easy to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.95,0:51:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.15,0:52:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happened to\Nthe gold in our territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.36,0:52:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,they would have an\Nexcuse to seize our property
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.39,0:52:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and destroy our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.63,0:52:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Inspector will have the\Nclan's shadow branch attack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.90,0:52:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yagyu shadow branch?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.67,0:52:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So the rumors of the\Nshadow Yagyu spies are true?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.64,0:52:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I am the shadow hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.99,0:52:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will reveal their sins to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.56,0:52:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my mission in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.83,0:52:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The gold reaches our\Nland tomorrow at ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.30,0:52:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.17,0:52:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.65,0:53:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a cedar grove here,\Nand a sacred tree here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.43,0:53:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the boundary.\NThis side is Shogunate land.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.90,0:53:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This side is land under our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.60,0:53:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only road that\Ngoes to our castle town.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.97,0:53:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop the gold\Nshipment before it reaches here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.98,0:53:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If it gets to our land, we are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.08,0:54:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Ogami Itto?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.69,0:54:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.52,0:55:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.45,0:55:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.53,0:55:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.33,0:56:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.63,0:56:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep together! Don't scatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.54,0:56:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.75,0:56:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.70,0:56:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares attack an official\Nperforming Shogunate business?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.21,0:56:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The 'Lone Wolf'! Prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.28,0:56:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The 'Lone Wolf'?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.08,0:57:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the fire out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.66,0:58:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.84,0:58:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.41,0:58:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.05,0:58:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Ogami!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.11,0:59:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.72,0:59:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he drinks this he will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.77,0:59:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Today and tomorrow are\Ncritical with a fever like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.52,1:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not get up with that fever!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.36,1:00:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Ogami, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.89,1:00:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The bell is calling me...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.03,1:00:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro... wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.64,1:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.38,1:00:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.95,1:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogami Itto.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Yagyu Bizen\Nnothing happened in this fief.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.86,1:01:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your scheme has come to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.37,1:01:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Itto! There is no water to help\Nyou on these stone steps!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.58,1:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanao... kill him...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.42,1:02:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.82,1:02:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We are assassins, remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.42,1:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.07,1:02:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.68,1:03:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.68,1:03:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you that hid\NDaigoro in the bath that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.93,1:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.01,1:03:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.51,1:03:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry and have children.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.98,1:03:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Live your life as a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.05,1:03:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.89,1:03:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is fate something you can avoid?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.93,1:03:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A child must follow in\Nthe path of its father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.87,1:04:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am still the child of Yagyu Retsudo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.75,1:04:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is fate something you can avoid?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.29,1:04:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A child must follow in\Nthe path of its father.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.67,1:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We will catch a huge carp.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.14,1:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father will eat it and get better.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.01,1:05:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Buddha's teachings can\Nbe taken in more ways than one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The five prohibitions, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.53,1:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! We got one!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.23,1:05:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We got one!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.47,1:05:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro! The basket!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.17,1:05:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are good at weaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.91,1:05:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, my husband died.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.62,1:05:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We had been married just three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.79,1:06:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I unravel what I weave,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.13,1:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then weave what I have unraveled...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.17,1:06:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for a tomorrow\Nthat will never come...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.21,1:06:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaving, weaving, all day, every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.95,1:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then finally...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.28,1:06:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,on the night you recovered...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.72,1:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished my weaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.13,1:06:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The thread of my tears...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.47,1:06:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is woven into the cloth of my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.34,1:06:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Chizuro...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.71,1:07:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,wife to Yagyu Hyogo,\Nwho died by your sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.14,1:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in this temple is the\Ngrave of Azami, your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.51,1:08:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew one day you\Nwere sure to come here...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.75,1:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to pray for your dead wife's soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.09,1:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.16,1:08:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know very well that\Nyour wife met her end...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.07,1:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at the hands of the Yagyu.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.41,1:08:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But a husband who has lost his wife,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.94,1:08:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,grieves no less than...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.91,1:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,a wife who has lost her husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.92,1:08:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know that!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.90,1:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,May I challenge you to a duel?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.19,1:09:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You may...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.69,1:11:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You allowed her to strike one blow?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.80,1:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell her it would\Nbe futile to challenge you...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.24,1:11:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems she was bound to do so.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.31,1:11:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.89,1:11:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To cut down an opponent\Nwho thinks they have won...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.97,1:11:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So they die thinking\Nthey have succeeded...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.64,1:11:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that is swordsmanship at its best.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.81,1:13:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See how happy my wife is?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.81,1:13:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.35,1:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We will raise him to be a great warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.42,1:13:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your trust in me.\NLet us adopt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.83,1:13:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As his father, you\Nhave to think of his future.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.40,1:13:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is what his\Nlate mother would wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.67,1:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.31,1:13:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.67,1:15:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.25,1:15:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.12,1:15:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.97,1:15:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.47,1:15:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.01,1:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.59,1:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you... I won't!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.06,1:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.83,1:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamberlain!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.97,1:16:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.65,1:16:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamberlain!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.82,1:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.48,1:17:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.99,1:17:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stand up!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.19,1:17:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.89,1:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.32,1:17:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.96,1:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.43,1:17:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.20,1:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow branch has been of no use.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.74,1:17:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bizen!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.21,1:17:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Face him with your official\Ntitle if you think you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.55,1:17:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't say we are of no use.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.29,1:17:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't depend on the sword forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.49,1:17:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fool yourself, Bizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.26,1:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the sword,\Nwhat is left of the Yagyu?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.74,1:17:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our weak point... our sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.21,1:18:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the only one who\Ncan bring Ogami down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.55,1:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere, Bizen!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.45,1:19:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't do that off the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddha will punish you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.05,1:19:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you\Nare doing, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.86,1:19:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.56,1:19:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.08,1:19:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, little guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.12,1:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.55,1:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.12,1:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.96,1:19:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Daigoro.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.87,1:20:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Ogami Itto's son?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.88,1:20:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.21,1:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.32,1:20:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.99,1:20:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.19,1:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.49,1:20:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Daigoro?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.93,1:20:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.13,1:20:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.87,1:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Down goes the old guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.34,1:20:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.27,1:20:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.12,1:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, that child is...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.54,1:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad come?\NOne sleep, Dad come?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.41,1:21:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Two sleeps, Dad come?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.01,1:21:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One... do... three...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.95,1:21:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not 'do', it's 'two'.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.25,1:21:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One... two... three... four...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.33,1:21:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Five...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.60,1:21:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.92,1:23:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.45,1:24:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.70,1:25:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have got Daigoro!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.94,1:25:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Raima!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.17,1:25:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.21,1:26:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.19,1:26:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.92,1:27:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanao!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.99,1:27:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.27,1:27:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.84,1:27:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you wish to put vengeance and wrath
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.54,1:27:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,in the hands of a small child?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.72,1:27:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you would put in...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.22,1:27:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the hands of your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.09,1:27:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with the sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.03,1:27:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the shadow Yagyu was strong...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.14,1:28:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I wanted in my hands...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.41,1:28:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,was my father's...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.85,1:28:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,my father's love...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.42,1:28:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my father's heart...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.84,1:28:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanao!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.53,1:29:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.39,1:29:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Retsudo...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.99,1:29:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should guard your family name.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.83,1:30:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of your family\Nhave you lost already?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And none of them for\Nthe sake of your Yagyu clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.54,1:30:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not realize that you have\Nbeen used by Lord Yagyu Bizen
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.54,1:30:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,in his crazed lust for power?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.25,1:30:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more so because the\Nshadow Yagyu cannot reveal itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.92,1:30:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect a warm welcome\Nthe next time you see Bizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.23,1:30:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For your clan, Yagyu Retsudo is a liability.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.91,1:30:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, I must bring this\Nmatter between us to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.55,1:30:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And that, too... is fate?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.00,1:32:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.74,1:32:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,People that do bad things...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.31,1:32:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.75,1:33:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.38,1:33:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.32,1:33:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.26,1:33:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.93,1:33:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sneaking into a place like this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.74,1:33:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.24,1:33:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.02,1:33:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro, boil some water!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.68,1:34:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dead, isn't it... again?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.26,1:34:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.47,1:35:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.69,1:36:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.66,1:36:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.13,1:36:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.20,1:36:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably the last\Ngift the Gods will give me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.75,1:36:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no greater joy for a woman...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.75,1:36:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,than to bring forth new life at last!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.96,1:36:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to think about her future.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.93,1:36:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to\Nwalk the street like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.10,1:36:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... such tiny hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.04,1:37:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro, where does the river flow to?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.57,1:37:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.94,1:37:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When the river flows into\Nthe sea, it turns to waves.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.15,1:37:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Big ones, small ones,\Nthey come in and go out,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.59,1:37:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,over and over again, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.23,1:37:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A wave!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.03,1:37:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A life is like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.03,1:37:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like these waves,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.67,1:37:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are born, you live, you die,\Nthen you are born again.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.45,1:38:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One day,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.68,1:38:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,your father will fall, and speak no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.39,1:38:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But just like the waves,\Nlife goes on forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.99,1:38:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is reborn, rolling forward again...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.36,1:38:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.40,1:38:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives never fade away...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.40,1:38:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,they never disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.05,1:38:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the next life,\Nyour father will be your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.13,1:38:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the life after that,\Nyou will be my son...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.51,1:39:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And Azami will be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.79,1:39:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.59,1:40:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.14,1:42:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.43,1:44:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fought well to be alive
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.14,1:44:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to face me now, Ogami Itto.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.74,1:44:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You are truly a demon\Non the path of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.21,1:44:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no sword under\Nheaven to match yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.58,1:44:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor, is there a samurai\Nto match you in chivalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.36,1:45:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It is tragic, that you must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.66,1:45:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the Yagyu clan which\Nrules the 60 provinces...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.57,1:45:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,only Yagyu Retsudo remains!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.28,1:45:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.15,1:45:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as these arms\Nand legs still move...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.02,1:45:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as these eyes still see...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.13,1:45:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.63,1:45:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the blood still flows...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.44,1:45:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,through this body.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.81,1:45:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.82,1:49:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That wonderful bare-\Nhanded grasp will not help.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.06,1:49:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.94,1:51:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.17,1:51:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure you had no strength left.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.88,1:51:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But Daigoro's eyes said otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.08,1:51:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes were those of\None who did not believe...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.52,1:51:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,his father would die.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.30,1:51:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.57,1:52:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.32,1:52:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.01,1:53:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop it, Daigoro.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.32,1:54:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Daigoro...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.99,1:54:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.87,1:55:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg leave to speak...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.81,1:55:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yagyu Retsudo and Ogami Itto
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.58,1:55:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,died this morning in combat\Non Nishiki-ga-hama beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.03,1:56:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your heart,\Nthough your father's skin burst
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.46,1:56:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and his blood spilled forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.67,1:56:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Though his body fell, do not shrink back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.31,1:56:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.74,1:56:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.68,1:56:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Though his eyes are closed,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.81,1:56:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and his mouth won't open, do not fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.85,1:56:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Reborn in the next life,\Nhe will still be your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.16,1:56:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In the life after that, you will be my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.86,1:56:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father and son we will be...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.17,1:56:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,for all eternity.
